                            <comment id="15168927" author="sboikov" created="Fri, 26 Feb 2016 12:47:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;It is supposed that &apos;initializeLocalAddresses&apos; is called once on node start before &apos;getRegisteredAddresses&apos; can be called, but there was as issue in ClientImpl: MessageWorker starts concurrently with &apos;initializeLocalAddresses&apos; call. Fixed it to start MessageWorker  after &apos;initializeLocalAddresses&apos; call.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
